OL,3,ABoy, 3, died choking on food, inquest
OL,4,Ahears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA three-year-old boy died after choking
OL,7,Fat a Greater Manchester nursery earlier
OL,8,Fthis month, an inquest heard.
OL,10,FThiago Wall died on 5 November after
OL,11,Fbecoming critically ill at Cosy Toes
OL,12,FNursery, in Middleton, on 2 November.
OL,14,FAn inquest at Rochdale Coroner's Court
OL,15,Fheard on Wednesday that Thiago had
OL,16,Fchoked on a bowl of food and died three
OL,17,Fdays later at the Royal Manchester
OL,18,FChildren's' Hospital. A CT scan later
OL,19,Fconfirmed the toddler had a brain
OL,20,Finjury.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
